        <mxCell id="deny" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#FF3621;&quot;&gt;no entitlement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:17px;&quot;&gt;0 rows, and the model is never called. A fluent answer from general knowledge is indistinguishable from a real retrieval.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=note;size=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FF3621;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1B3139;fontFamily=DM Sans, DM Sans 14pt, Segoe UI, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DDM%2BSans%3A400%2C500%2C700;" vertex="1" parent="q">
